   "daf": "20a",
   "sentenceId": 3,
   "he": "רַבִּי יְהוּדָה מַכְשִׁיר בְּקָטָן. (דְּתַנְיָא) אָמַר רַבִּי יְהוּדָה: קָטָן הָיִיתִי, וּקְרִיתִיהָ לְמַעְלָה מֵרַבִּי טַרְפוֹן וּזְקֵנִים בְּלוֹד. אָמְרוּ לוֹ: אֵין מְבִיאִין רְאָיָה מִן הַקָּטָן.",
   "en": "§ It was taught in the mishna: «Rabbi Yehuda says that a minor is fit» to read the Megilla. «It is taught» in a baraita: «Rabbi Yehuda said:» I can offer proof to my opinion, as when «I was a minor I» myself «read» the Megilla «before Rabbi Tarfon and the» other «Elders in Lod. They said to him» in response: «One cannot bring a proof from» the testimony of «a minor.» Since at the time of the supposed incident you were a minor, you are not qualified now to testify about it."
  }
 ],
